    <string name="disclaimer_dialog_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text"><![CDATA[<b>Privacy Statement</b><br/> This app processes URLs locally on your device and does not collect, store, or transmit any user data or URLs to external servers.<br/><br/> <b>Clipboard Access</b><br/> By using the Paste button, the app reads your last clipboard entry and checks if it\'s a valid link. By using that button, you acknowledge this access.<br/><br/> <b>URL Modifications</b><br/> While we strive to maintain URL functionality, some links may not work as expected after cleaning. Users can always use the original URL if needed. Proxy services such as fixupx.com and kkinstagram.com are not owned or maintained by us and may stop working at any given time.<br/><br/> <b>Third-Party Services</b><br/> This app is not affiliated with nor endorses usage of third-party proxy services such as fixupx.com and kkinstagram.com. These services are independent and may have their own terms and privacy policies.<br/><br/> <b>Trademarks</b><br/> Names of the applications such as Twitter, X, Instagram and others whose links this application cleans from tracking are trademarks of their respective owners. This application is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with those services.<br/><br/> <b>External Links</b><br/> Cleaned URLs will open in your device\'s default browser or the respective app. We are not responsible for content on external websites.<br/><br/> <b>Disclaimer of Warranty</b><br/> This software is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement.]]></string>
    
